SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The bbcc utility is compliant with the IEEE Std 1003.1-2008 (“POSIX.1”)
     specification.

     The flags [--ccee], as well as the parts noted above, are extensions to that
     specification.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The bbcc command first appeared in Version 6 AT&T UNIX.  A complete rewrite
     of the bbcc command first appeared in OpenBSD 3.5.

AAUUTTHHOORRSS
     The original version of the bbcc command was written by Robert Morris and
     Lorinda Cherry.  The current version of the bbcc utility was written by
     Otto Moerbeek.

BBUUGGSS
     The ‘quit’ statement is interpreted when read, not when executed.

     Some non-portable extensions, as found in the GNU version of the bbcc util‐
     ity are not implemented (yet).

